{{Enemy Infobox|Snecko}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Confused}}
'''Snecko''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] encountered exclusively in [[Act 2]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Snecko}}
Always starts with {{Int|Snecko|Perplexing Glare}}, then uses one of the following actions each turn:
* {{Int|Snecko|Bite}} (60% chance)
* {{Int|Snecko|Tail Whip}} (40% chance)
Snecko will not use {{Int|Snecko|Bite}} three times in a row.

== In Party With ==
=== Act 2 ===
As a hard pool encounter:
* Solo

== Tips ==

== Trivia ==
* Snecko is a portmanteau of the words "snake" and "gecko".
* The {{R|Snecko Eye}} and {{R|Snecko Skull}} [[Relics]] are references to this enemy.
* Snecko's '''Tail Whip''' may be a reference to the ''Pokémon'' [https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Tail_Whip_(move) move of the same name].
* Snecko appears in the artwork of {{C|Rebound}}.

